        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo CP-258, Cylinder Hole Filler Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-5/8 Inch Cylinder Plate is used on wood or metal doors to help accommodate a 1-1/4 Inch cylinder in a 2-1/8 inch hole. It is most commonly used in conjunction with an exit device where you would like only a cylinder on the exterior of the door. It can be used with rim or mortise cylinders. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-CP258-specifications.gif?v=1704354555\" width=\"410\" height=\"194\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo CP-258 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Hole Resize Plate for Cylinders:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2.625\" (2-5/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Cut-out Diameter: 1.25\" (1-1/4\")</li>\r\n<li>Will cover a 2-1/8\" standard hole bore.</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 16 gauge (.060)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
